{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "advancing-game",
  "family": "game-tick",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "Start x=0,energy=3,tick=0,hp=3 on integer cells 0..4. status takes only op and returns {x,energy,tick,hp}. step takes op and action in {left,right,wait}. dash takes op and direction in {left,right}.",
    "A left/right step moves one cell and costs 1 energy. A dash moves two cells and costs 2 energy, only checking its destination. wait stays put and restores 1 energy capped at 3. After validation, if hp=0 reject every step/dash with game_over. Otherwise check destination bounds first (out_of_bounds), then required energy (exhausted). Errors do not advance tick or mutate state.",
    "On an accepted step/dash: apply movement/energy, increment tick by 1, then if x=2 and the resulting tick is even, subtract 1 hp. Return status. Hazard applies to wait too, and only to the final destination. hp never goes below zero because hp=0 closes gameplay."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "tick": "One accepted game command, including wait.",
    "hazard": "Damage at cell 2 on even logical ticks.",
    "dash": "One tick of movement crossing two cells."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--initial",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "status"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "x": 0,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 0,
          "hp": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--hazard-after-movement",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "x": 1,
          "energy": 2,
          "tick": 1,
          "hp": 3
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 1,
          "tick": 2,
          "hp": 2
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 2,
          "tick": 3,
          "hp": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--dash-and-exhaustion",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "dash",
          "direction": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "dash",
          "direction": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "right"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 1,
          "tick": 1,
          "hp": 3
        },
        {
          "error": "exhausted"
        },
        {
          "x": 3,
          "energy": 0,
          "tick": 2,
          "hp": 3
        },
        {
          "error": "exhausted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--bounds-and-recharge",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "left"
        },
        {
          "op": "dash",
          "direction": "left"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "out_of_bounds"
        },
        {
          "error": "out_of_bounds"
        },
        {
          "x": 0,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 1,
          "hp": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--terminal",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "dash",
          "direction": "right"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "wait"
        },
        {
          "op": "dash",
          "direction": "left"
        },
        {
          "op": "step",
          "action": "fly"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 1,
          "tick": 1,
          "hp": 3
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 2,
          "tick": 2,
          "hp": 2
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 3,
          "hp": 2
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 4,
          "hp": 1
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 5,
          "hp": 1
        },
        {
          "x": 2,
          "energy": 3,
          "tick": 6,
          "hp": 0
        },
        {
          "error": "game_over"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "advancing-game--continuous-hazard",
      "requirements": [
        "The cell-2 hazard damages hp on every accepted tick, not only even ticks. Movement/energy still apply before damage. Both step and dash obey it."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
